# Wazuh APT repository — REMOVED Oct 26, 2026.
#
# The repo line below was dropped because the matching GPG key was never
# committed (config/archives/wazuh.key.chroot does not exist), so apt
# refuses the repo as unsigned: NO_PUBKEY 96B3EE5F29111145, "The repository
# is not signed." In the chroot stage that was only a warning, but in the
# lb_binary stage apt returns an error and live-build aborts the build.
# That is what killed HAVEN build attempt 7 after the squashfs was built.
#
# Nothing installs wazuh-agent yet, so the repo serves no purpose right
# now. Re-add it properly when the agent is actually installed: restore
# the deb line AND commit the key file, with its fingerprint verified
# against current Wazuh docs out of band. Do not re-add the repo line
# without the key.
#
# Removed line was:
# deb https://packages.wazuh.com/4.x/apt/ stable main
